Anyswitch
=======

Third-party trademarks
----------------------

The control panel displays the names, logos, icons and brand colors of the
third-party products it integrates with: ZCode, Claude Code, DeepSeek (DSH),
Kimi Code, Qoder, OpenCode, and Pi. Anyswitch also reads and writes
configuration files belonging to these products on the user's own machine.

These names, logos, icons and brand colors are trademarks of their respective
owners. They are used solely to identify the products Anyswitch integrates
with. Anyswitch is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by the owners
of any of these marks, and no such relationship should be inferred.

`anyswitch.ico` is original artwork created for this project. It is not
referenced by any file in this repository: it is used from outside the repo, as
the icon of the desktop shortcut that launches the control panel.
